  "source_shape_findings": [
    "Independent page offsets must be removed: B1/1F/2F/3F/4F/5F/6F/7F/R y subtractions = 9/8/25/2/10/8/8/0/0 pixels. Raw and normalized traces both retained; genuine deeper 3F rear wings/upper terraces are not removed as page drift.",
    "+Y is source-plan upper projecting long side. Looking from +Y, +X plan-right single-stair end becomes photo-left. White screens are on this end/705 frontage zone; the large recessed glass and buff horizontal beams are on the opposite -X/photo-right side. No unsupported compass bearing or full-705-stair claim.",
    "Central 6F/7F polygonal labels are occupied rooms/circulation: no false atrium or octagonal outer tower. R is an asymmetric continuous stepped flat roof with unequal end accesses, not a generic single rectangle or a hole above the central rooms.",
    "True under-canopy air and recessed entrance remain. Thick curved fascia, supports, red frame proxy and attached platform lie on the supported entrance side. Separate 学思/學思 bridge span is excluded at the attachment scope: no invented free bridge end at a drawing break line.",
    "v8 coplanar nearest-material white-triangle spill on buff faces is absent in the final nine views. v10 small 0.12 mm floor-edge offsets and 0.09 mm terrace-cap insets preserve explicit color boundaries; these are documented modeling approximations rather than measured construction dimensions.",
    "White-screen gaps are backed exterior recesses in a solid-mass study, not asserted open interior stairs. Glass is an opaque color proxy; interior rooms are not reconstructed. Unseen rear windows are explicitly sparse approximations, not copied/mirrored photo evidence."
  ],
